			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Remove dead Git::Shared::Generated wrapper and eliminate unused Library re-exports\n\nDelete the `Generated` module from `Source/IPC/WindServiceHandlers/Git/Shared/` which was a thin wrapper around `uuid::Uuid::new_v4()`. Replace all calls to `Generated()` with direct `uuid::Uuid::new_v4().to_string()` in HandleExec, HandleRevListCount, and HandleRevParse.\n\nRemove unused `Air` and `Cache` module re-exports from `Source/Library.rs` and the `Client` module re-export from `Source/Vine/mod.rs`, continuing the absolute-path migration to eliminate local indirection layers.\n\nThis cleanup removes dead code and aligns the Git service handlers with the project's direct-delegation pattern.",
