			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Normalize Vine import separation in GenericRequest handlers\n\nSplit combined import statements in 24 CocoonService generic request handlers to separate local `crate::` bindings from absolute `::Vine::Generated` path imports. Apply consistent two-line import pattern across Commands, Secrets, and WindowDialogs service handlers, plus InitialHandshake and MountainVinegRPCService.\n\nThis continues the absolute-path migration ensuring all gRPC types delegate exclusively to the canonical Vine library crate without local indirection or malformed combined imports.",
