			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Eliminate final local Vine module re-exports and normalize absolute imports\n\nRemove the deprecated `Generated` and `Client` module re-exports from `Source/Vine/mod.rs`, completing the migration to absolute-path delegation for the gRPC protocol layer. Update `Source/Vine/Server/Initialize.rs` and `MountainVinegRPCService.rs` to import `::Vine::Generated` types directly.\n\nRefactor 90+ `Source/RPC/CocoonService` handler files to replace `crate::Vine::Generated::{...}` with `::Vine::Generated::{...}`, applying the same pattern across Auth, Command, FileSystem, Provider, Window, Workspac, and Terminal service handlers. Consolidate `Source/RPC/CocoonService/mod.rs` import order for clarity.\n\nThis finalizes the multi-commit absolute-path migration, ensuring all Mountain IPC and service logic delegates exclusively to the canonical Vine library crate with zero local indirection.",
